(In real estate development and land acquisition, billions of dollars are committed annually under severe informational) Tj
T* (asymmetry. Determining whether a specific land parcel is viable currently requires manual intervention across siloed domains:) Tj
T* (interpreting complex municipal zoning byelaws, calculating regulatory setback buffers, hand-drafting CAD massing models, and) Tj
T* (constructing speculative financial spreadsheets. This traditional feasibility cycle takes 2 to 4 weeks and costs substantial) Tj
T* (consulting capital per plot, creating severe friction in fast-moving land markets.) Tj
